'''T1''' is a global esports joint venture created by [https://www.comcastspectacor.com/ Comcast Spectacor] and [https://www.sktelecom.com/ SK Telecom] that owns and operates teams in ''[[leagueoflegends:T1|League of Legends]]'', ''Fortnite'', ''[[dota2:T1|Dota 2]]'', ''[[pubg:T1|PUBG]]'', ''[[smash:T1|Super Smash Bros.]]'', ''[[hearthstone:T1|Hearthstone]]'', ''[[rainbowsix:T1|Rainbow Six Siege]]'', ''[[apexlegends:T1|Apex Legends]]'', ''[[overwatch:T1|Overwatch]]'' and ''[[splitgate:T1|Splitgate]]''.

